# The shipped theme is formatted by hand and stays that way.
#
# Prettier's CSS output is correct but loses two things this theme relies on:
# rules written on one line as an aligned table — 123 of them, the status bar's
# flex order map among others — and the palette's uppercase hex, which the
# Dracula spec fixes in that form. A `/* prettier-ignore */` marker covers one
# node only; CSS has no range markers, so keeping the current shape would cost
# 123 markers and still lose the column alignment of trailing comments.
#
# init.js is excluded for the same reason: tab indentation and braces on their
# own line are house style, and prettier rewrites both, touching 3650 lines of
# 2610.
